本之旅添上一層穩妥與舒適！讓交通工具不要限制你的旅途足跡，任意在日本自由趴趴走（到處逛）吧！</p><p>相關文章：福岡自由行｜地鐵/西鐵/JR九州交通攻略　實測自用APP　附票價</p><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887255980183552184732.jpeg/QcytjkIaPVewMvtP6NSwEV-D_lZGam9lwuSKVcLkilU\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（kkday；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887258056495104714652.jpeg/lWowQfPCRBNqkKf2zvQ886IxWqvaxXdI2_hc0tv4XNI\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（kkday；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887260128612352186973.jpeg/R0Xj2FT0xpx0xpExerNaJRo0RHbIBPT-Hq2vOh6trzo\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887262154592256087935.jpeg/Oxbyaz0YiF4I7nL7C7uqljxg56ng7fvTBKjo-wSo6Ps\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887264067325952543719.jpeg/up1IMkApvLgkJlJ2nj0q6j3R32fDFoA3oW9Pa6FvT2s\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887252977061888185932.jpeg/bdhli3ftPNuJ9ARNwGPY2jpQyAoF9YgDOpy3ZTqct2U\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887255175008256782164.jpeg/NZWkLztgttNUKrBWgmoGsQbsbRNWXgUsCTUx6Ak1Meg\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887257070964736401263.jpeg/22dtnIYllnp_MwtJvgLHQGjHVwZIHre2AmbHXgJmx14\"/><figcaption>福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"福岡交通攻略：地下鐵（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092887258857869312159062.jpeg/BYsKBuMinV